# Feed: the tab, its days, scrolling to the last entry above the tabs and Call, the oldest entry
# (loaded as the list reaches its end) clear of the tabs, an entry opened and Back. The stand-in
# answers /feed with made-up days.
launch /
shoot now
tap hex-tab-feed
shoot feed
mark hex-tabs
scroll home-list-feed
shoot scrolled
scroll home-list-feed
scroll home-list-feed
scroll home-list-feed
shoot end
still hex-tabs
apart feed-done:t-7 hex-tabs
tap hex-tab-now
tap hex-tab-feed
shoot again
tap feed-done:t-1-open
shoot opened
tap chrome-back
shoot back
